  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The projectile motion of a particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is shown in the figure.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0073_bf3fe82dbe58.png\" style=\"width: 314px; height: 113px;\" /></p><p>The initial velocity of the particle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ms</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and the air resistance is assumed to&nbsp;be negligible. The magnitude of the change in&nbsp;momentum between the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>kgms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>,&nbsp;to the nearest&nbsp;integer, is ___ .</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0073_2b4117b4b452.png\" style=\"width: 291px; height: 170px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>45</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>45</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>vsin</mi><mn>45</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>"
